etter-spacing=\"2.4\" fill=\"#2f3a44\">NOTES</text>\n<text x=\"60\" y=\"1456\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#4a5560\">1.  PARTS 4, 5 AND 6 FORM THE STANDARD THREE-PIECE PLUNGER FILTER:  CROSS PLATE (4) + COMPRESSION SPRING (5) + MESH SCREEN (6).</text>\n<text x=\"60\" y=\"1480\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#4a5560\">2.  THE PLUNGER ROD (2) SCREWS INTO THE THREADED HUB OF THE CROSS PLATE (4) AND PASSES THROUGH THE CENTRE HOLE IN THE LID (3).</text>\n<text x=\"60\" y=\"1504\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#4a5560\">3.  PARTS ARE SHOWN IN ASSEMBLED ORDER ALONG THE PLUNGER AXIS;  ARROWS INDICATE THE SEQUENCE OF ASSEMBLY.</text>\n<text x=\"1340\" y=\"1456\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"13\" letter-spacing=\"2\" fill=\"#7d8b98\">EXPLODED VIEW &#183; N.T.S.</text>\n<text x=\"1340\" y=\"1480\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"13\" letter-spacing=\"2\" fill=\"#7d8b98\">SHEET 1 / 1</text>\n</svg>\n",
